    "title": "Budget-three antipodal pure quartic has exact degree drop one",
    "status": "PROVED",
    "closure": "proof",
    "statement": "In the centered antipodal quotient pencil, if the outer parameter quartic has e_2=e_3=0, the second-derivative Wronskian proves deg V=r-1 and factors exactly as Y^(d-2)U^2V^2 times a nonzero linear polynomial. Both U,V are squarefree, and at most one root of UV lies in the deleted divisor or at zero. On the maximal official row deg V=2^37-2.",
